Incredible, the tentacles are burning.

I received word that the Pristonian troops, led by our Squad Leaders, are face to face with Midranda. Meanwhile, Midranda's hordes, strengthened by the lost experiments he took from Yagditha's laboratory, are being fought by Zarad's triton army outside the Sanctuary of the Abyss.

I will use the Ancestral Flame to awaken the Magic Censer's full power with the essence of the tentacles.

Please, prepare your supplies in the meantime.

Come back here when everything is ready.
